-- 3321 (release 48, part TRK; docs/changes/2026-11-20-r48-tracker-alerts.md): the notices of the tracker events (3320), per the
-- owner's definition of done: a branded email, an in-app and push alert, a text, and an entry in the notification preferences.
--   renter_tracker_notice   a charge or a breach (speeding over a limit, outside Ontario, past the return time, the Tracker
--                           unplugged or tampered with, at a pound): always sent (money and the agreement), by text at once
--   renter_driving_notice   a heads-up with no charge (over the speeding alert level, harsh driving): the renter may mute it
--   owner_tracker_alert     the car's owner, the event and the place only: the owner may mute it
--   staff_pound_flag        Fleet and Admins, when a car is parked at a pound (beside the urgent To do and staff alert)
-- Staff keep staff_tracker_alert and staff_tracker_alert_fleet (0400: in-app and push, topic alerts, on or off in each
-- person's alert settings) for every kind, and the staff alert tracker_pound (3320).
set local check_function_bodies = off;

